/P 128 0 R
/E (The college is home to several vibrant student-led associations that actively contribute to the all-round development of students. These include Team Drishti, Team Avaroh, Fatal String Dance Club \(FSDC\), Team Gandharva, Team Chitraksha, Team Sankalp, the UPSC Chapter, the Entrepreneurship Cell \(Team Kautilya\), Bhaskaracharya Math Club \(BMC\), and the National Service Scheme\(NSS\). In addition to these, the college also hosts various departmental associations such as ELITE \(EXTC Department\), ITSA \(IT Department\), CHESA \(Chemical Engineering\), PESA \(Production Engineering\), EESA \(Electrical Engineering\), and MESA \(Mechanical Engineering\). These departmental bodies focus on enhancing the technical, analytical, and practical skills of students in their respective fields. The primary objective of all these associations is to foster essential soft and professional skills among students, including communication, teamwork, leadership, time management, and much more. Through workshops, events, and collaborative activities, they play a vital role in shaping well-rounded, industry-ready individuals.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [11]
