/E (Pragyaa, an annual technical fiesta at the national level, is held at SGGSIE&T, Nanded gives students a chance to showcase their skills in technical arenas. Every year, it has a positive theme that focuses on technology and societal welfare. Students flock in large numbers to take part in a variety of events, such as the peer robotics competition, the junior scientist brainstorming session, and to see a range of exhibits. Every year, it elevates to new heights of splendor by concentrating on the superiority of technology for the welfare of people and incorporating fresh elements into its success.)
